OL,3,GNEWSAMove to fine excess or damaging
OL,4,Abranchages
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response to a written question from
OL,7,FDeputy Hilary Jeune, he said when
OL,8,Freviewing the law the committee would
OL,9,Fconsider enforcing fines for landowners
OL,10,For contractors cutting hedgerows or
OL,11,Fbanks "if necessary".
